		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1017" title="View the profile of Chubz Drago">Chubz Drago</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 7<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/yoda2.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1017"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1528.msg16573#msg16573"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1528.msg16573#msg16573">Re: pointless cockblocking</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #62 on:</b> April 21, 2005, 02:49:24 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Rather then doing a long post (which I just deleted in the saving of drama) I&#039;ll just say some general comments.<br /><br />To Anyone that needed the loot:<br /><br />I&#039;m sorry.  It was never my intention to &#039;cockblock&#039; you from the loot which would&#039;ve been gained from the event.<br /><br />To People that think it was an asshole thing to do:<br /><br />I&#039;m not sorry.  Anyone that knows me to a decent degree knows I love to push the envelope in content.  If that means boxing a Msha in Qvic, or boxing a Fennin Ro trigger that is regardless.  In this case sadly loot was lost for some other players.<br /><br />To the People that think there was no reason to kill the trigger:<br /><br />There were two reasons to do so.<br /><br />#1 I got experience from the kill.  This played about 0% into the debate of if my group should kill it or not.<br />#2 My group did intend to actually finish through the entire script.  However I did not know about the concentration of mobs for the initial pull (the demon surrounded by like 8 (?) guards).  I did not have the pull team required to do that, so I decided to leave after attempts failed and pulling them out.  Yes we stayed for more then &quot;1 minute.&quot;&nbsp; The goal in my mind was to do two things really:<br /><br />1.&nbsp; Open up mobs that would have no competition over.<br />2.&nbsp; Get to F Ro and box him.&nbsp; <br /><br />Being unable to pull stopped that rather quickly.&nbsp; As such we decided to leave as we were running very low on mobs.<br /><br />To Kinsonn:<br /><br />Grow up.  Attacking people in rude means does you nothing.<br /><br />Once again to those that would&#039;ve received loot I am sorry.<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
