							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1528.msg16750#msg16750">Quote from: Zorlo on May 02, 2005, 06:54:30 pm</a></div><div class="quote">So really in the grand scheme of things, it wasnt a big deal. But i mean really the position is indefensible, how can you say wasting a mob for lower guilds is ok because you were testing yourself? Go kill Tunat or MM if you are looking for a challenge, the lower guilds need those mobs.<br /></div><br />We do :P - This was an off night for raiding so wanted to keep going! -- Btw this thread isl ike 2 weeks old now <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /> Go flame IL for blowing Coirn trigger from UoP or something! They did it so they could raid it later, while we did it with the intention of raiding it now - imo, that&#039;s a big difference.&nbsp; Blowing it so you can do it later while another guild is setting up is cockblocking, killing a trigger and trying to do the ring and failing -isn&#039;t.
						</td>
					</tr>
