								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1528.msg16754#msg16754">Re: pointless cockblocking</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #66 on:</b> May 02, 2005, 11:06:15 pm &#187;</span></td>
