							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							If he did it to attempt the event then thats one thing.&nbsp; I have no problem with it if they try to attempt it and figure out its more then they could handle.&nbsp; On the other hand if they do it screw with someone then thats a bit diffrent.&nbsp; Meaning that They didn&#039;t need to kill him becuase it doesnt effect there pop progression.&nbsp; If he says he is doing it to attempt the event then it&#039;s not that big of a deal.&nbsp; &nbsp;Just don&#039;t use the lame excuse of we are doing a just better then normal mob thats a trigger to &quot;test&quot; our skillz becuase thats a BS staement and you know it.&nbsp; The FR trigger mob is not even on the same scale as the named that he has 1 grouped or boxed in OoW or GoD or even DoN.&nbsp; Thats like saying I solo Fippy Darkpaw for the challange.&nbsp; Like I said if he did it to try the encounter thenits no big deal but if he did it to &quot;test&quot; himself then thats a lame weak ass excuse.
