						<td>
							<a name="bot"></a><b>Pages:</b> <a class="navPages" href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1528.0">1</a> <b> ... </b><a class="navPages" href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1528.30">3</a> <a class="navPages" href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1528.45">4</a> [<b>5</b>] 
